                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, “Even if Moses and Samuel were standing here pleading with me, I would not show these people any mercy. Make them go away; make them get out of my sight. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 13.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they ask you where they should go, tell them that I have said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What an unhappy man I am! Why did my mother bring me into the world? I have to quarrel and argue with everyone in the land. I have not lent any money or borrowed any; yet everyone curses me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", may all their curses come true if I have not served",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "LORD, …served",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " you well, if I have not pleaded with you on behalf of my enemies when they were in trouble and distress. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(No one can break iron, especially the iron from the north that is mixed with bronze.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, “I will send enemies to carry away the wealth and treasures of my people, in order to punish them for the sins they have committed throughout the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make them serve their enemies in a land they know nothing about, because my anger is like fire, and it will burn for ever.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I said, “",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", you understand. Remember me and help me. Let me have revenge on those who persecute me. Do not be so patient with them that they succeed in killing me. Remember that it is for your sake that I am insulted. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You spoke to me, and I listened to every word. I belong to you, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God Almighty, and so your words filled my heart with joy and happiness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I did not spend my time with other people, laughing and having a good time. In obedience to your orders I stayed by myself and was filled with anger. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why do I keep on suffering? Why are my wounds incurable? Why won't they heal? Do you intend to disappoint me like a stream that goes dry in the summer?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To this the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " replied, “If you return, I will take you back, and you will be my servant again. If instead of talking nonsense you proclaim a worthwhile message, you will be my prophet again. The people will come back to you, and you will not need to go to them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make you like a solid bronze wall as far as they are concerned. They will fight against you, but they will not defeat you. I will be with you to protect you and keep you safe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will rescue you from the power of wicked and violent people. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
